{
  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">高盛：华硕PC产品组合升级与AI服务器客户扩展，2Q26业绩超预期</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">华硕7月营收新台币<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">840亿元</span>，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">53%</span>，比GS预期高出<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">16%</span>。这份由GS分析师Allen Chang团队发布的报告，核心判断是华硕正处在PC产品组合升级与AI服务器出货放量的双重驱动期，但内存成本上升会在下半年对PC终端需求形成压制。报告更新公司观点。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">先看第<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>数字。华硕2Q26营收新台币2,<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">577亿元</span>，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">37%</span>、环比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">24%</span>，比GS预期高<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">9%</span>，比彭博一致预期高<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">7%</span>。毛利率<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">17.2%</span>，环比提升2.3个百分点，同比提升3.4个百分点，同样大幅超出预期。管理层把毛利率改善归因于供应链管理能力和AI服务器出货爬坡带来的制造效率提升。营业利润率8.1%，净利润新台币190亿元，比GS预期高出88%。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这份报告最值得<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">注意</span>的不是营收<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">超预期</span>本身，而是<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">超预期</span>的来源结构。GS把2Q26的beat归因于PC拉货和AI服务器出货增长，但毛利率的跳升幅度远大于营收增幅，说明产品组合变化比单纯出货量增加更能解释利润弹性。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVibibLOcB5sVibNjPxRzzjWauMh367eEhMbSFE8qPgmM6oobopS2mA7meibbBHHGzUQDfLic8ib9yMSJicGdcWnpa7t1MnMWb2eB6Hds/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">1. 7月营收<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">超预期</span>后，8-9月预计继续环比增长</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">GS预计华硕8月营收新台币<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">883亿元</span>，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">41%</span>、环比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5%</span>；9月进一步增至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">963亿元</span>，环比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">9%</span>。7月营收环比下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">21%</span>形成低基数，加上AI服务器整机柜出货爬坡，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>整体营收预计新台币2,687亿元，同比增长34%。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">但进入<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">四季度</span>，GS预计10月和11月营收环比分别下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">15%</span>和<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">12%</span>。原因有两个：内存成本上升会抑制PC终端需求，AI服务器产品线切换也会造成出货节奏波动。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">四季度</span>营收预计环比下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">15%</span>，同比增速节奏变化至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">13%</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">把这件事拆开看，华硕的营收节奏呈现明显的“前高后低”形态。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>靠AI服务器整机柜出货和PC产品组合升级撑起高增长，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">四季度</span>则要消化内存涨价和产品切换的谨慎影响。GS在报告里明确说，内存成本上升是PC业务最大的不确定因素。</p>\n<blockquote style=\"margin:16px 0;padding:10px 14px;border-left:3px solid #AAB4C3;background:#F7F8FA;color:#4B5565;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\">简单说，模型通常按订单能见度线性外推，但整机柜AI服务器的交付节奏更集中、单季波动更大；后续更值得观察的是8-9月实际出货能否兑现GS预期的环比增长，这决定了<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>营收质量。</blockquote>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVP8pj9PlQF73S1yTXHX7FtmmvY6bu5E3j8B76RWhlFupZWicSSjWuoh8ewey024ckMBbbd9FjoXtv3N8stL5ouBticypYyV9PWM/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">2. 毛利率跳升3.4个百分点，但<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027</span>-28年预计回落</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">2Q26毛利率<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">17.2%</span>，比GS预期高2.8个百分点，比彭博一致预期高3.5个百分点。管理层归因于供应链管理和AI服务器出货爬坡带来的制造效率。GS把<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span>毛利率预测从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">14.6%</span>上调至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">15.5%</span>，但把<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027年</span>和<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2028年</span>毛利率分别从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">15.5%</span>和15.6%下调至15.1%和15.3%。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">下调的理由很直接：整机柜AI服务器出货占比提升会稀释整体毛利率。AI服务器虽然拉动营收，但利润率低于华硕传统的PC和主板业务。GS同时把<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026</span>-28年营收预测分别上调<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">12%</span>、<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8%</span>和<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8%</span>，主要反映全球产能<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>后整机柜AI服务器业务的更高贡献。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这里有个值得<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">注意</span>的结构性变化。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOU5j0wicMyvbwHonut9bMDhHK4bTlDM29xYcxlsLibQrlmevoJY1OvAnFrstCdC8wjwrD42DyIqhDYA1bZboAB8Sy1p6Os9JqBew/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUB9vsojBibDgA7szlJacckBlPlqsILBg6Y6Zm1xXlJJP8sGZy73w0j5jL7054Y40Vfj6IL57n23MfMLJAkKKxXoztGKQIicQtv8/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 21-GS-Asus -2357.TW-- PC enjoying product mix upgrade- AI server client base expansion- July - 2Q26 beat- 报告观点-260820</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
